 of international design experience. Her work has been seen on both stage and screen across the United States, Canada, and the UK. \nShe holds a BFA in Design for the Theatre from Concordia University, and an MFA from the University of Missouri - Kansas City, one of the top costume design programs in the world. Over the course of her professional career, Ms. Bohn has taught at prominent academic institutions in both the USA and Canada.\nAs a professional set and costume designer, Ms. Bohn loves the collaborative aspect of her job, and is always willing and happy to travel. She speaks English, French, and German, as well as some Spanish and Italian, and holds Canadian and EU passports. Ms. Bohn is a proud member of the Associated Designers of Canada (IATSE ADC 659) and IATSE Local 873.\nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkNo\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
