born, Toronto-based theatre artist with 10+ years of experience as a Light designer, director, actor, producer, and stage manager. He founded Rangaai Theatre Company in 2016, creating immersive, sensory-driven performances. A recipient of the Associated Designers of Canada Mentorship Grant to train under Trevor Schwellnus. He is currently apprenticing in Lighting Design with Michelle Ramsay, supported by the Ontario Arts Council.\nLight Design credits - An Imm-Permanent Resident (Nautanki Bazaar & Factory Theatre, 2026), NEW (Alumnae Theatre, 2026), Ishq Ke Saat Muqaam (Tawoos Initiative, 2025), The Proposal by Anton Chekhov (Mississauga Fringe, 2025), Akathya (Rangaai Theatre Company, 2025), Aap Ka Khayal Aaya (Sawitri Theatre, 2025), Miss Cuckoo (Nautanki Bazaar Productions, 2024). Assistant & Apprentice Light Design - The Cunning Linguist (Aluna Theatre, 2024), Cicadas (NAC, Tarragon Theatre, 2026), and Hansel & Gretel Panto (Capitol Theatre, 2025).\nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkYes\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
