hristopher is a creative who lives, works, and plays as an uninvited guest on the traditional and unceded (stolen), ancestral territories of the xʷməθkwəy̓əm (Musqueam), Skwxwú7mesh (Squamish), Stó:lō, and Səl̓ílwətaʔ/Selilwitulh (Tsleil-Waututh) Nations. \nTheir design credits (costume/set) include: The Arts Club; Capilano University; Carousel Theatre; Citadel Theatre; Douglas College; Frank Theatre; Hardline Productions; Honest Fishmongers; Mascall Dance; Pacific Theatre; Patrick Street Productions; Realwheels Theatre; Radical Systems Art; Shaw Festival; Slamming Door; Studio 58; Theatre Northwest; Touchstone Theatre;  VACT; Yogurt Theatre Company;  Zee Zee Theatre.\nThey are also a teacher, wardrobe head, and museum worker. A multiple Jessie & Ovation Nominee, and Studio 58 Production Graduate                                                http://www.christopherdavidgauthier.com\nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkYes\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
