n of performance based art and interactivity. Some of her select credits include: Technical Director 2021 (Guilty by Association), Projection Designer ZEITGEIST (OFF THE NOSE 2025), Projection Designer Hedwig and the Angry Inch (Bowtie Productions, 2024) Projections Designer 2021: Mechanisms to Hold  by Cole Lewis (Tarragon Greenhouse Festival 2024), Technical Director The Division by Andrew Kushnir (Tarragon +TMU 2022), Technical Director INSERT CLOWN [HERE] (Toronto Fringe 2023), Producer and Technical Director VELVETHEAD (Pickles Theatre Co 2022), Projections Designer VELVETHEAD (Que(e)ries? Festival 2022). Alex is also a freelance technician, installing theatre, events, and exhibits all over the GTA!\nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkYes\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
