ropolitan University with a BFA (Hons.) in Performance Production in 2015. She’s been working mostly in Southern Ontario, designing for independent theatre productions in Toronto as well as working as an assistant designer at Stratford Festival and Shaw Festival.\nIn 2020, She’s been nominated for Pauline McGibbon Award.  For the past two years, she worked as a resident designer at Motyer-Fancy Theatre at Mount Allison University. \nSelected Design Credits\nSet and Costume design:Kim's Convenience, Grand Theatre (2023)Kim's Convenience, Thousand Island Playhouse (2022)A (Musical) Midsummer Night’s Dream, Driftwood Theatre (2019)Cannibal, Next Stage Festival; Scrap Paper Theatre (2019)Judas Noir, Obsidian Theatre & BDB Productions (2018)Shaw Festival Director’s Projects (2016)\nSet & Projection Design:The Supine Cobbler, Great Canadian Theatre Company (2023)\nSet Design: Pass Over, Obsidian Theatre Company (2019)\nCostume Design:Richard Three, Shakespeare in the Ruff (2023)The Drawer Boy, Watermark Theatre (2022)Portia’s Julius Caesar, Hart House Theatre (2019)Resonance, Human Body Expression (2019)\nProjection Design: Okay, You can Stop Now, Theatre Passe Muraille (2023)Omisimawiw, Riser Edmonton (2023)\nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkYes\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
