 sound designer and audio technician based out of Montreal and an upcoming graduate from the Production Design and Technical Arts program at the National Theatre School of Canada. His background in composition and music production finds his interests pushed primarily towards sound design. However, he is also curious to explore video design and its interaction with sound in storytelling.\n \nHis work in theatre is rooted in collaboration as a means to inspire and the use of technology in storytelling. With his roots in French Theatre, he is also interested in working within that community. In the future, he hopes that his work will allow him to travel around Canada and beyond.\nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkYes\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
