.   He is the recipient of an Emmy nomination, an Art Directors Guild Award nomination, three Jessie Richardson Theatre Awards for Outstanding Set & Costume Design, six Ovation Awards, the Ottawa Critics Circle Award, and the Vancouver Mayor's Arts Award.  He holds a degree in theatre from UBC, and is a member of Associated Designers of Canada and IATSE 891.  Marshall lives in Vancouver, BC. \n\n\n\n\nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkNo\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
