nd set designer. She has worked with theaters across Nova Scotia and Newfoundland, including Rising Tide Theatre, Festival Antigonish, Halifax Theatre for Young People, Halifax Opera Festival, Mocean Dance, Symphony Nova Scotia, The Royal Nova Scotia Tattoo, Neptune Theatre and The Stephenville Theatre Festival. Her work can be seen on stage and in museums. She is a member of The Associated Designers of Canada and she’s been nominated for a Theatre Nova Scotia Merritt award for costume design and was recipient of the 2019 Wes Daniels design award. \nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkYes\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
