ecialises in Lighting, Set Design, and Lighting for Modern Dance. Matthew is the current Lighting Director for Ballet BC, a professor of Theatre at The University of the Fraser Valley and a member of the Associated Designers of Canada. Recent Productions: Momentum of Isolation, Lighting Designer (Radical System Art); Mixed Nuts, Lighting Designer (Arts Umbrella); Bolero X, Associate Lighting Designer (Ballet BC); Noises Off, Associate Lighting Design (The Arts Club); The Wars, Lighting Designer (UBC); The Rocky Horror Show, Lighting and Set Design (Alchemy Theatre) CV: MatthewPiton.com\nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkYes\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
