        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\tChange your cover photoUpload Change your cover photoUpload\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tApply\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Cancel\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSimon Rossiter\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tToronto-based lighting designer who occasionally designs sets.\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tThis user account status is Approved\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAbout\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAbout\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosts\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPosts\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tComments\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tComments\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tThis user has not added any information to their profile yet.E-mail Addresssimonrossiter@me.comWebsite URLhttp://www.simonrossiter.comPhone Number416-875-8355Design Discipline(s)LightingPreferred Pronoun(s)he/himResidence — Province/TerritoryOntarioLanguages SpokenEnglish, FrenchResidence — RegionTorontoFacebookFacebookInstagramInstagramBioA Toronto-based lighting designer who occasionally designs scenery, Simon's original designs have garnered three Dora Mavor Moore Awards from eleven nominations, and he has received two nominations for the Pauline McGibbon award in design. A dual citizen of Canada and the United States, Simon is eligible to work in both countries.\nOriginal designs for dance include Contes pour la fin du temps; Julie et l'univers; A Perfect Day; Four Old Legs; Jusqu'à Vimy; Against Nature; Les Paradis Perdus; #lovesexbrahms; Elvis & the Man in Black; From the House of Mirth (Citadel+Compagnie); Burn Baby, Burn; Crypto; X(Dix); Touch (CôtéDanse); Hamlet (CôtéDanse and Ex Machina); Ring; Persefony Songs; Noisy; Animated; Marienbad; Singular Bodies, New York/Toronto & Brussels/Toronto; Eleven Accords; Rivers (Toronto Dance Theatre); MOEM (Body); Armband (Human Body Expression); Svāhā (NovaDance); dark with excessive bright (Ballett am Rhein); the edge of now; what it's like (adelheid dance projects); with a trace (firstthingsfirst); From There to Here (National Arts Centre); Kismet; The Dreamers Ever Leave You (National Ballet of Canada). He has designed dance works for the National Ballet School and the School of Toronto Dance Theatre.\nTheatre designs include Inside American Pie (Harmony House / Mirvish); Fool for Love; Little Menace; The Secret Chord; Frankly, Sinatra; The Dead; The Thirst of Hearts (Soulpepper Theatre Company); Les Metamorphoses 2023; Les Misérables (Theatre Smith Gilmour); Hockey Dreams; For Life; The Romeo Initiative; In Piazza San Domenico (Sudbury Theatre Centre); Les Précieuses Ridicules; Les Zinspirés; Le Fa Le Do; Les Fourberies de Scapin (Theatre Français de Toronto); Frankenstein (Theatre New Brunswick); We Three; Byhalia, MS; pool (no water); Pieces (Cue 6); Into the Woods; Robin Hood; Macbeth (Hart House); The Ward Cabaret (Ward Productions); s h e e t s (Veritas Theatre); Pandora in Blue Jeans; The Idiot; The Clowns (Humber College).\nSimon is the Director of Design for Toronto's Fall for Dance North.\nHe proudly serves as the Business Agent for Local ADC659.\nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkYes\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
