 Asia, lives in the west side of Canada. She is a citizen of nature. Her motto: Explore, Experience, Enhance.\n\n\n\n\nHer explorations are at the intersection of art, design and technology, focusing on immersive experiences and new modes of storytelling. Drawing on her collective knowledge of new multimedia, architecture, industrial design and creative code practices, she explores design in performance art, theatre and dance, and interactive installations. She works internationally and has had shows and exhibitions in Canada, USA, Iran and Turkey. She received the best stage design award for the Kid's Puppet Festival in Iran in 2020. Some of her recent works include the projection designer of Siranoush as part of Rutas Festival 2022, the Associate Video Designer of Rubble, produced by Aluna Theatre, in 2023 and was part of the technical team of the 2023 national tour of La Bulle, produced by Corpus. \nCurrently, she is studying for her MFA at Simon Fraser University, focusing on performance art and technology. \nCover photo: Rubble, 2023\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkYes\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
