ewanLanguages SpokenEnglishResidence — RegionSaskatoonInstagramInstagramBioJudith Schulz (she/her) is a Saskatoon-based theatre designer, director, producer, and administrator with a passion for making stories come alive through lighting, projection design, abstract sets, or support roles like stage management. She currently serves as the Executive Director for the Saskatchewan Association of Theatre Professionals, where she uses the values of care and progress through a lens of optimistic realism to bring programming and development to the theatre sector in Saskatchewan.  Select credits: “The Revolutionists” (Lighting, Persephone Theatre), “The Herd” (Projections, Persephone Theatre; SATAward Receipient) “The Curst” (Projections, Dancing Sky Theatre), “A Brontë Without Genius” (Lights, Planter Box Theatre/Live Five), “This is How We Got Here” (Projections, Persephone Theatre; SATAward Nominee), “Zastrozzi: The Master of Discipline” (Lights, Eisenschmetterlinge Collective/Live Five), “The Unplugging (Lights/Projections, Burnt Thicket Theatre, SATAward Nominee), “Luna” (Lights, 25th Street Theatre), “Yaga” (Director/Producer, Two Bees Productions/Live Five), \"The Romeo Initiative\" (Lights, Persephone Theatre). See her work at https://judithschulz.ca/  Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/judith.e.schulz/ or @judith.e.schulz \nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkYes\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
