rlottetownInstagramInstagramBioCory Sincennes Is An International Scenic And Production Designer. His Set, Costume, Lighting Designs Have Been Seen Throughout Canada, Europe And Russia. He Has Garnered Both National And International Recognition For His Design Work, And Is Quickly Establishing Himself As “Someone To Watch” In Design For Live Performance.\nBeginning His Education In Ontario,Canada Cory Earned A Degree In Architectural Studies From Carleton University Before Studying Theatre At Ryerson University. In The Fall Of 2010, He Received His MFA In Theatre Design From The University Of Alberta.\nOutside Theatre, Cory Continues To Enjoy Work As A Freelance Stylist, Visual Merchandiser, Event Designer For Various Companies And Events, Both Large And Small.\nHe Currently Resides In Charlottetown,PE, Canada.\nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkNo\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
