er based in Edmonton, Alberta. I got involved in music and theatre at a young age. My primarily professional practice is sound designer and live sound reinforcement having working for a number of theatrical and dance companies across Canada, for over 20 year.\nI also experiment with sound and acoustic engineering in my personal art practice building custom guitars and stringed instruments from exotic hardwoods and found objects. My instruments can be found in the hands of musicians, on displayed in galleries and out at guitar shows.\nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkYes\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
