g. He specializes in lighting and projection design. Previous credits includes ShadowCatch (2022, UBC Opera), Soulmate (2022, DramaOne), Echoes From Far Away City (2022, Blackout Theatre), Cranked (2021, Green Thumb Theatre), Cipher (Assistant Lighting Design, 2020, Arts Club Theatre), The Automatic Earth (2019, UBC Bands)\n \nHe is also interested in combining theatre arts into different performing art platforms. He believed that live performance is an engaging experience with the audience. His vision in various performing art spaces including opera, recitals, live theatre, live-streamed performances allows him to create a world that the audience can experience an immerse storytelling from the performance. One of the most successful and innovative project was a collaboration with artist Clive-hicks Jenkins and UBC School of Music to produce an interactive projection performance in 2019.\n \nWhile he is actively involved in Vancouver theatrical community, he has also designed few shows in Hong Kong before coming to Canada and completed a few professional certificate courses in Hong Kong Academy of Performing Arts.\n \nHe graduated with Bachelor of Fine Art in Theatre Design and Production in University of British Columbia (UBC) in 2020 and currently a full member of the Associated Designers of Canada.\nAvailable for Work?YesAvailable for Assistant/Associate WorkYes\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 1000px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-body {\n\t\t\tmax-width: 600px;\n\t\t}\n\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\twidth: 190px;\n\t\theight: 190px;\n\t}\n\t.um-113.um .um-profile-photo a.um-profile-photo-img {\n\t\ttop: -105px;\n\t}\n\t\t\t.um-113.um .um-profile-meta {\n\t\t\tpadding-left: 250px;\n\t\t}\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t"
